        {
          "id": 2883850391,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "IIRC this code is only called if the dissector is enabled by the user (there's a preference for \"load db\", which is disabled by default), so it shouldn't affect most users.\n\nThis file is changed more frequently than Wireshark releases, and we need a convenient way to update it regardless of upstream updates.\n\nWe currently use an internal plugin for that (in which the load paths are the only difference), but I'd love to get rid of it.",
          "author": {
            "id": 4838727,
            "username": "orgads",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Orgad Shaneh",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d1663e2309e26976c90f9aced3f52852da603ca06f78b81af61db6f4007fcc6b?s=80&d=identicon",
